// pvp-sdk: the Ancient Magicks spellbook (pvp_kit/scripts/ancients.rs2), laid out as the real one:
// its 24 spells by level, 4 to a row, the 8 teleports between the 16 combat spells. Icons are
// 377's own (magicon2/magicoff2: ice 6-9, smoke 10-13, blood 14-17, shadow 18-21 as Rush, Burst,
// Blitz, Barrage; teleports 22-29), and the hover panels follow magic.if's. Generated: edit the
// generator, not this file.
